# The static image is the app, public guide and generated guide screenshots. Everything
# else is repository-only documentation, test material, tooling or history.
#
# Note what this means for Dockerfile.harness, which does COPY . .  — `tools` and `docker`
# are excluded here, so the harness image does NOT contain tools/validate-local.mjs. It works
# only because docker/compose.validate.yml bind-mounts the tree over /app at run time. If you
# ever want that image to stand alone, this file is why it does not.
.git
.github
.claude
docs/*
!docs/screenshots/
!docs/screenshots/**
test
tools
spikes
node_modules
docker
*.md
!LICENSE
